c 2) in make test since 17:1x today; the second also read DT_PCELL's enum from descr.h, where it has not been since b275c0c27 split descr_tags.h out (its arm 0 read RED once the refusal lifted). Both read the layout and descr_tags.h now and pass on the step-7 tree.

